flowchart TB
    developer([Developer])

    subgraph local[Current local development environment]
        apphost[AppHost<br/>Aspire orchestration]
        web[Web<br/>Blazor placeholder page]
        api[API<br/>ASP.NET Core foundation endpoint]
        bot[Discord bot host<br/>Worker logs startup only]
        sql[(SQL Server<br/>Local development resource)]
    end

    developer -->|starts local environment<br/>dotnet run| apphost
    developer -->|opens placeholder<br/>browser| web
    developer -->|checks foundation endpoint<br/>HTTP| api
    apphost -->|starts process| web
    apphost -->|starts process| api
    apphost -->|starts process| bot
    apphost -->|provisions resource| sql
    web -->|receives API service reference<br/>Aspire configuration only| api
    bot -->|receives API service reference<br/>Aspire configuration only| api
    api -->|receives database reference<br/>Aspire configuration only| sql

    classDef person   fill:#fce5cd,stroke:#b45f06,stroke-width:1px,color:#000
